SUMMARY:Claire Hooper: Fun Show xx
LOCATION:Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:Claire is gonna do what it takes – joke t-shirts\, family gla
 mping\, practical jokes\, birdwatching\, laser tag and rock concerts – to
  become fun again. A rollercoaster of jokes from an adult who doesn't enjoy
  rollercoasters. Host of The Great Australian Bake Off and Claire Hooper's 
 House of Games. AACTA 2025 nominee\, Best Stand-Up Comedy Special 2024\, an
 d winner of Piece of Wood Award at Melbourne International Comedy Festival.
  'Getting out to any comedy gig is a "type two" endeavour\, but if it's Hoo
 per's\, the effort is most certainly worth it' **** (Chortle.co.uk).\nMore 
 info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/claire-hooper-fun-show-xx/
